(2454991, 338201, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  However, this is a rather complex photo.  Remember, photographer''s first Rule of Thumb:  Simply!  You might try to crop to the lower RH corner keeping one swath of snow, and focus with F/2 or F/3.5 on the little bird.  Great eye none-the-less.  :)<br/>   And there you go...a little Welcome Free Advice (or not) from a friendly "arm-chair quarterback."</td>', 'Great concept!  However, this is a rather complex photo.  Remember, photographer''s first Rule of Thumb:  Simply!  You might try to crop to the lower RH corner keeping one swath of snow, and focus with F/2 or F/3.5 on the little bird.  Great eye none-the-less.  :)   And there you go...a little Welcome Free Advice (or not) from a friendly "arm-chair quarterback."', '2006-05-24 22:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
