(2456444, 337977, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute - especially the expression. The focus is kind of soft, and that straight-on flash is kind of flat.</td>', 'Very cute - especially the expression. The focus is kind of soft, and that straight-on flash is kind of flat.', '2006-05-25 13:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
