(2457269, 335854, 50127, '<td valign="top">Perfect!!! Best photo in the bunch!<br/>The green of the background compliments the green tone to the chickadees feathers and the green in the worm and the beige of the clothe  compliments all the lighter areas of the bird.  I love the title, too, because you can look at it from two points of view- thats probably what the bird is thinking, and thats what the photographer is thinking at the same time.  What a fantasic shot!  Please make this a print if you can :)</td>', 'Perfect!!! Best photo in the bunch!The green of the background compliments the green tone to the chickadees feathers and the green in the worm and the beige of the clothe  compliments all the lighter areas of the bird.  I love the title, too, because you can look at it from two points of view- thats probably what the bird is thinking, and thats what the photographer is thinking at the same time.  What a fantasic shot!  Please make this a print if you can :)', '2006-05-25 17:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
