(2457736, 338148, 46782, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this is going to place very high! The model is lovely - the composition/ idea really make it. Well done.</td>', 'I have a feeling this is going to place very high! The model is lovely - the composition/ idea really make it. Well done.', '2006-05-25 19:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
