(2457931, 336610, 38032, '<td valign="top">touching - and great hues.  If the camera was moved up just a hint it would help the composition a  lil but really nice as is.  A great candid moment.</td>', 'touching - and great hues.  If the camera was moved up just a hint it would help the composition a  lil but really nice as is.  A great candid moment.', '2006-05-25 20:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457936, 338046, 38032, '<td valign="top">I think a simpler shot at 2 or 3 of these elements would have been stronger.   The angle here seems very rushed and snap-shottish.  i know the feeling.</td>', 'I think a simpler shot at 2 or 3 of these elements would have been stronger.   The angle here seems very rushed and snap-shottish.  i know the feeling.', '2006-05-25 20:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
