(2457976, 338236, 38032, '<td valign="top">Bing that this is such a highly photographed and public item, I think without other props the image needs to be perfectly exposed, composed and lit to be effective.  This one isn''t doing that for me.</td>', 'Bing that this is such a highly photographed and public item, I think without other props the image needs to be perfectly exposed, composed and lit to be effective.  This one isn''t doing that for me.', '2006-05-25 21:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
