(2462329, 336955, 48528, '<td valign="top">Love this picture, but I cannot find the relation with the contest.</td>', 'Love this picture, but I cannot find the relation with the contest.', '2006-05-27 19:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462331, 338198, 48528, '<td valign="top">It seems it''s out of focus</td>', 'It seems it''s out of focus', '2006-05-27 19:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462365, 337996, 57775, '<td valign="top">Really like the idea here (and your dog is a very cute model).  I just wish the background was more asthetically pleasing, i.e. as in a solid color and maybe with a shallower depth of field, or maybe something that fits the theme like outside in a jungle / forest setting.  (And you could then title it "The Real King of the Jungle") - just a couple ideas.</td>', 'Really like the idea here (and your dog is a very cute model).  I just wish the background was more asthetically pleasing, i.e. as in a solid color and maybe with a shallower depth of field, or maybe something that fits the theme like outside in a jungle / forest setting.  (And you could then title it "The Real King of the Jungle") - just a couple ideas.', '2006-05-27 19:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462370, 337945, 57775, '<td valign="top">Great action shot &amp; you definitely captured a feeling of success, especially with the huge smile the trainer is wearing.  Just seems a little over-exposed &amp; and maybe slightly too high in contrast IMO.  Still like it a lot though.</td>', 'Great action shot & you definitely captured a feeling of success, especially with the huge smile the trainer is wearing.  Just seems a little over-exposed & and maybe slightly too high in contrast IMO.  Still like it a lot though.', '2006-05-27 19:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462373, 338279, 57775, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-05-27 19:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462375, 337014, 57775, '<td valign="top">Love the picture, but the matte / frame thing you have going on seems very overpowering &amp; detracts from the image.</td>', 'Love the picture, but the matte / frame thing you have going on seems very overpowering & detracts from the image.', '2006-05-27 20:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462378, 337574, 57775, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... love the grace you''ve captured here; the crop &amp; placement of the bird seem perfect too... I''ll look to see this one at the top...</td>', 'Beautiful... love the grace you''ve captured here; the crop & placement of the bird seem perfect too... I''ll look to see this one at the top...', '2006-05-27 20:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462383, 336584, 57775, '<td valign="top">Love the soft feel of the cocoon, but I wish the caterpillar was more in focus, with more light on it.  Also, the foreground / bottom of the photo is very distracting &amp; overpowering, and doesn''t really add anything.  I think a tighter crop, maybe rotated so that the caterpillar seems to be crawling vertically, would help this out a lot.</td>', 'Love the soft feel of the cocoon, but I wish the caterpillar was more in focus, with more light on it.  Also, the foreground / bottom of the photo is very distracting & overpowering, and doesn''t really add anything.  I think a tighter crop, maybe rotated so that the caterpillar seems to be crawling vertically, would help this out a lot.', '2006-05-27 20:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462387, 337931, 57775, '<td valign="top">I like the concept &amp; I think it''s been executed very well.  The only thing I would change is the hand placement as it covers up too much of the main forcus of your shot - the card.</td>', 'I like the concept & I think it''s been executed very well.  The only thing I would change is the hand placement as it covers up too much of the main forcus of your shot - the card.', '2006-05-27 20:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462389, 337818, 57775, '<td valign="top">Does not seem to meet the challenge to me - also the background could use some improvement.</td>', 'Does not seem to meet the challenge to me - also the background could use some improvement.', '2006-05-27 20:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462393, 337195, 57775, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  I love this one.  Although I think lightening it up would help it out - check out the levels in photoshop - seems to be leaning pretty heavily to the left.</td>', 'Adorable!  I love this one.  Although I think lightening it up would help it out - check out the levels in photoshop - seems to be leaning pretty heavily to the left.', '2006-05-27 20:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462394, 338277, 57775, '<td valign="top">Does not seem to meet the challenge.  Also, contrast is a bit high - the flower is very overexposed, making it difficult to make out any details.</td>', 'Does not seem to meet the challenge.  Also, contrast is a bit high - the flower is very overexposed, making it difficult to make out any details.', '2006-05-27 20:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462396, 338251, 57775, '<td valign="top">Love this one - great capture!!  Will definitely look to see this one finish at the top.</td>', 'Love this one - great capture!!  Will definitely look to see this one finish at the top.', '2006-05-27 20:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462397, 338203, 57775, '<td valign="top">Haha... not sure if this really captures "success" but I really like it anyway.</td>', 'Haha... not sure if this really captures "success" but I really like it anyway.', '2006-05-27 20:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462401, 336589, 57775, '<td valign="top">Really like your idea here, and I can tell that you wanted the background a little blurry to make the foreground the main focus, but the background is so blurry it''s difficult to even make out what''s back there.  (One person?  Two?  A person holding her foot up in the air?)  Still like the concept a lot though.</td>', 'Really like your idea here, and I can tell that you wanted the background a little blurry to make the foreground the main focus, but the background is so blurry it''s difficult to even make out what''s back there.  (One person?  Two?  A person holding her foot up in the air?)  Still like the concept a lot though.', '2006-05-27 20:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2462404, 336340, 57775, '<td valign="top">I''m continually reminded on this site that sometimes the simplest, most basic concepts are the most powerful.  Your photo is a great example of this.  Very good job - like it a lot.  I''m sure you''ll finish high.</td>', 'I''m continually reminded on this site that sometimes the simplest, most basic concepts are the most powerful.  Your photo is a great example of this.  Very good job - like it a lot.  I''m sure you''ll finish high.', '2006-05-27 20:25:20.000000', NULL, 1);
