(2467886, 337014, 42957, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the borders, but the image itself is cute.  There could be a little more contrast or shadows between the white door and the white dress.  That would make the cherubic little girl pop out more.  The peeling paint on the door is a nice touch.  On the whole, this is a sweet capture and going to favs!  Good job!</td>', 'I''m not sure about the borders, but the image itself is cute.  There could be a little more contrast or shadows between the white door and the white dress.  That would make the cherubic little girl pop out more.  The peeling paint on the door is a nice touch.  On the whole, this is a sweet capture and going to favs!  Good job!', '2006-05-30 05:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2467891, 338317, 42957, '<td valign="top">I like how the photo fades to black at the bottom. <br/> <br/>It''s a little oversharpened/over contrasted on some places--the white specks and blob above the subject''s head--the concept and composition and dramatic lighting, however, really works and makes it a cut above the other graduation-themed ones. :)</td>', 'I like how the photo fades to black at the bottom.  It''s a little oversharpened/over contrasted on some places--the white specks and blob above the subject''s head--the concept and composition and dramatic lighting, however, really works and makes it a cut above the other graduation-themed ones. :)', '2006-05-30 05:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
