(2470535, 337977, 75713, '<td valign="top">I want to tell you a bit about how I score a photo.. of course, does it meet the challenge.... does it tell a stroy... does it hold my interest?... then I go to  the technical parts of it...... let''s go to this shot that does not deserve to be in last place...... this shot tells me a story..... an indepth story about a baby that is so loved.... this precious child is smiling..... it is being photographed by ppl who love it..... lovely skin.... good weight... taken care of.... smiling face.... being loved.....could this photo been in sharper focus..... yes. could many of the higher ranking photos be as sensitive, as loving as well composed    yep... but they weren''t.. they were just better focussed....... almost time for me to leave this site..... be proud of your entry</td>', 'I want to tell you a bit about how I score a photo.. of course, does it meet the challenge.... does it tell a stroy... does it hold my interest?... then I go to  the technical parts of it...... let''s go to this shot that does not deserve to be in last place...... this shot tells me a story..... an indepth story about a baby that is so loved.... this precious child is smiling..... it is being photographed by ppl who love it..... lovely skin.... good weight... taken care of.... smiling face.... being loved.....could this photo been in sharper focus..... yes. could many of the higher ranking photos be as sensitive, as loving as well composed    yep... but they weren''t.. they were just better focussed....... almost time for me to leave this site..... be proud of your entry', '2006-05-31 03:46:17.000000', NULL, 0),
