(2471754, 338129, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. The use of negative space in combination with the light and that punch of red, really makes for a winning shot.  Congratulations on such a well deserved finish.</td>', 'Excellent image. The use of negative space in combination with the light and that punch of red, really makes for a winning shot.  Congratulations on such a well deserved finish.', '2006-05-31 11:56:51.000000', NULL, 0),
