(2474625, 338061, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>Definitely meets the challenge!  I think I''d like it a little less "middle" for some reason, or maybe kind of "hanging instead of what looks be lying rather flat.  Colors are good, focus and sharpness are excellent.  A bit of a color cast on the background - not sure if that can be removed using levels, but might be worth a try.  Most importantly, though, tell your son congrats!</td>', 'Trading Post commentDefinitely meets the challenge!  I think I''d like it a little less "middle" for some reason, or maybe kind of "hanging instead of what looks be lying rather flat.  Colors are good, focus and sharpness are excellent.  A bit of a color cast on the background - not sure if that can be removed using levels, but might be worth a try.  Most importantly, though, tell your son congrats!', '2006-06-01 00:33:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2474657, 338129, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>Congratulations on a new best, a GREAT score, and a top 10!!  I didn''t vote on this challenge but I did flip through the thumbnails and opened those that really said "success" to me without reading the title - this was one of those.  Everything here works - colors are wonderful and the greenish mist at the feet really sets off the shadow nicely.  Composition and framing is perfect.  A very lovely photograph, very well done!</td>', 'Trading Post commentCongratulations on a new best, a GREAT score, and a top 10!!  I didn''t vote on this challenge but I did flip through the thumbnails and opened those that really said "success" to me without reading the title - this was one of those.  Everything here works - colors are wonderful and the greenish mist at the feet really sets off the shadow nicely.  Composition and framing is perfect.  A very lovely photograph, very well done!', '2006-06-01 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 0),
