(2477653, 338052, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is one image that has a universal ring for us all. It is an image that projects the essence of adaptation regarding our early struggle which begins with so much innocence. The capture deserves praise in its great use of a partial silhoutte and now look at those cute feet!<br/>Congratulations on your RED.</td>', 'This is one image that has a universal ring for us all. It is an image that projects the essence of adaptation regarding our early struggle which begins with so much innocence. The capture deserves praise in its great use of a partial silhoutte and now look at those cute feet!Congratulations on your RED.', '2006-06-01 23:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
