(2493919, 338052, 38032, '<td valign="top">Yup - shutter was 1/2000 ... the "sun" room is very bright in thge morning because the sun is direct ... and because i was shooting with a small DOF (f2.5), I needed even more shutter speed.  And yes, she is one fast baby!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-07 08:33:37.</i></td>', 'Yup - shutter was 1/2000 ... the "sun" room is very bright in thge morning because the sun is direct ... and because i was shooting with a small DOF (f2.5), I needed even more shutter speed.  And yes, she is one fast baby!', '2006-06-07 09:32:59.000000', '2006-06-07 09:33:37.000000', 0),
