(2495399, 338117, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>I think this is a beautiful family portrait, composition is pretty good, could use some crop of the top to make it 4X5 ratio.<br/>the colors are great, and the focus is good.<br/>the only thing wrong is that it doesn''t show success.</td>', '[[trading post]] I think this is a beautiful family portrait, composition is pretty good, could use some crop of the top to make it 4X5 ratio.the colors are great, and the focus is good.the only thing wrong is that it doesn''t show success.', '2006-06-07 16:25:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2495507, 338082, 40718, '<td valign="top">temba, sorry it took me so long to respond.  I like your shot but can instantly see that you got stung with the DNMC crowd.  Only your title pulls the picture into a "success" shot.  Some people buy that, others don''t.<br/> <br/>The technicals are pretty well done.  I like the composition a lot.  The  repeated motif of the OOF flowers in the background is nice.  The colors are pleasant.  The DOF is a bit tough.  I like it, but it looks like you have some artifacting around the stems in the back.  It could be a result of the bokeh of your lens or it could be a PP artifact.  I''m guessing the first since you say you didn''t do too much to the shot.  You can see it most in the lower right corner.</td>', 'temba, sorry it took me so long to respond.  I like your shot but can instantly see that you got stung with the DNMC crowd.  Only your title pulls the picture into a "success" shot.  Some people buy that, others don''t. The technicals are pretty well done.  I like the composition a lot.  The  repeated motif of the OOF flowers in the background is nice.  The colors are pleasant.  The DOF is a bit tough.  I like it, but it looks like you have some artifacting around the stems in the back.  It could be a result of the bokeh of your lens or it could be a PP artifact.  I''m guessing the first since you say you didn''t do too much to the shot.  You can see it most in the lower right corner.', '2006-06-07 17:00:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2496897, 338129, 2490, '<td valign="top">==Trading Post==<br/> <br/>I love the negative space.  It does intrigue me that she''s looking OUT of the picture and it comes across this well.  A good example of breaking rules and it working well.<br/> <br/>The lighting - obviously out of your control - IS a bit harsh :)<br/> <br/></td>', '==Trading Post== I love the negative space.  It does intrigue me that she''s looking OUT of the picture and it comes across this well.  A good example of breaking rules and it working well. The lighting - obviously out of your control - IS a bit harsh :) ', '2006-06-07 23:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
